<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-049" chapter-id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family" source-id="s-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family-ws2199702">
  <p id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p001:m0000" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">裕</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p001:m0002" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">思曠</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0000" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">裕</persName>曰：「雖屢辭王命，非敢爲髙也。吾少無宦情，兼拙於人間，既不能躬耕自活，必有所資，故曲躬二郡。豈以騁能，私計故耳。」年六十二卒。三子：<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0067" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_A">傭</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0069" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_B">寧</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0071" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_C">普</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0000" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_A">傭</persName>，早卒。<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0005" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_B">甯</persName>，鄱陽太守。<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0012" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_C">普</persName>，驃騎諮議參軍。<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0021" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_A">傭</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0023" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_AA">歆之</persName>，中領軍。<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0030" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_B">甯</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0032" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_BA">腆</persName>，秘書監。<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0038" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_BA">腆</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0040" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">萬齡</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0043" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_AA">歆之</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p003:m0046" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_AAA">彌之</persName>，元熙中並列顯位。</p>
</text>
